    {
      "turn_id": "01",
      "event_type": "user_speech",
      "speaker": "Alice",
      "target": "Bob",
      "action_type": "speak",
      "text": "马上国庆假期了，要不要出来玩？国庆不想一直待在香港，太无聊了。"
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "02",
      "event_type": "user_speech",
      "speaker": "Bob",
      "target": "Alice",
      "action_type": "speak",
      "text": "可以呀。你想去哪里玩？"
